- **v1.4.0 (Current):** Domain XII (Institutional Integrity & Governance) added. Silence Clause codified. Cathedral Method expanded to 7 elements. Prediction log verified by Abbey. Cascade Engine expanded to 79 rules. Immutable Kernel specification approved. Sentinel Zero continuity protocol ratified. Warden Resilience Charter ratified. Quarry Credibility Module operationalised. Status icons revised (⚫ Black Acute, 🟣 Black Structural). Sentinel‑BALTIC deployed.

*This Constitution is effective as of 23 May 2026. It supersedes all prior versions.*
